### 1. Invite (requires a logged-in member's JWT)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "carol@example.com" }

> {%
  client.global.set("inviteToken", response.body.inviteToken);
%}

### 2. Register (consume the invite token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteToken": "{{inviteToken}}",
  "name": "Carol",
  "password": "hunter2"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("jwt", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "hunter2" }

> {%
  client.global.set("jwt", response.body.token);
%}

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health
